code calls ACURRSTR--the strength taken to calculate weight capacity.
Quoting an earlier article of mine:

Strength         WStr
~~~~~~~~~~~~     ~~~~
    3 -   18     3-8
18/00 - 18/31    19
18/32 - 18/81    20
18/82 -    21    21
   22 -    25    22-25

assuming one's NOT polymorphed, levitating, riding, on air, with
wounded legs, the (unburdened) carrying capacity is

        min{1000, 50 * [(WStr + Con) / 2 + 1]}

